{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人李施嬅早前參加內地真人騷《再見愛人5》，正式與前未婚夫車崇健分道揚鑣，其後全身投入工作，不但密密出席品牌活動吸金，還為有份演出的電影《空槍》連跑幾場謝票，忙到分身乏術。</p><p>昨日（21日）她在社交網出Po，留言：「一天3個城市，又來了！</p><p>」並拍</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:23:57.386894+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T01:01:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T01:18:01.390594+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T01:18:01.390594+00:00","content_hash":"3f2c43016df82ccfadab431cf4989d6a2e1ce3d6edc038767511172a506435a0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}